 - 2026-06-13: THE DECISIVE verifier graft — DEFENSIVE, gated on (val>=0.85 AND outer-loop train STOPPED). Reads (never writes/trains) the stable checkpoint. IF faithful+stable: rerank (verifier vs TRM-vote, pass@1 lift CI) + verifier-cert-vs-vote-cert RFT de-confound on a COPY of the checkpoint. IF not: DEFER honestly (outer-loop still training / not yet 0.85). Resolves the moat question + the DiffusionGemma gate when it fires. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: graft_deferred_outerloop_training_val_0.5148; results/experiment_4168_decisive_verifier_graft_defensive.json
 - 2026-06-13: ARC-AGI-3 INCREMENTAL +1 (monotonic) via the PROVEN explore-first method. Bounded active-exploration OBSERVES transitions -> induce mechanic + goal predicate -> GAP-4 verifier validates on held-out transitions -> act only if validated. Next-easiest non-spatial game not yet solved. REAL-ENV-CONFIRM any solve; STOP at the first level that fails. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: incremental_progress_no_solve_no_unsolved_nonspatial_candidates; results/experiment_4169_arc_incremental_progress.json
 - 2026-06-13: SOTA-INGESTION SLOT (reserved; bleeding-edge track): ingest verifier-as-reward / energy-guided-generation literature mapped onto the (outer-loop) Sudoku baseline -> graft headline + the queued DiffusionGemma energy-guidance use. TRM 2510.04871, TTA-TRM 2511.02886, V-STaR 2402.06457, SEDD 2310.16834, classifier/energy-guided diffusion. SOTA->experiment mapping note; flag strongest for .387. Cite real arXiv IDs. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_verifier_moat_guidance_mapped_v387; results/experiment_4170_sota_ingestion_verifier_moat_guidance.json
